title: "LureRadar: open threat radar for hyped-launch scams"
abstract: >-
  Explainable detection of fake downloads, key-generator traps and phishing
  lures around hyped product launches, with daily public blocklists,
  reproducible benchmarks and a source-cited PC release tracker.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "LureRadar contributors"
